[if final > 32.7 && final <50.1]
<img src="images/very-good.png" class="score-icon"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been an outstanding mayor for Phonopolis. **Congratulations!** <br>

[if final > 28.7 && final <32.6]
<img src="images/good.png" class="score-icon"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been a good mayor for Phonopolis. 

[if final > 22.7 && final <28.6]
<img src="images/neutral.png" class="score-icon"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been an avarage mayor for Phonopolis. 

[if final > 14.7 && final <22.6]
<img src="images/bad.png" class="score-icon"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You have been a poor mayor for Phonopolis. 

[if final <14.6 && final >2]
<img src="images/bad.png" class="score-icon"> <br>
Your score is {final} of 50. <br><br>
You barely survived this legislative period in Phonopolis.


[if final > -5]
[[Run for office again|Start]]
</div>

<div style="font-size:15px; text-align:right;">
