A circular economy for smartphones means keeping phones useful for as long as possible instead of throwing them away quickly. Key strategies include <b>reduce</b> (buy and use fewer new phones), <b>reuse</b>, <b>repair</b>, and <b>recycle</b>, which help save resources and reduce waste.

